    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Asynchronous Raft snapshot creation and log compaction interface.</para>
<para>All public methods are async; no blocking calls on the public interface.</para>
<para>Security: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_raft_snapshot_manager_1a25b04c4309e69323db5285917446fc38" kindref="member">compactLog()</ref> validates the <ref refid="structthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_snapshot_handle" kindref="compound">SnapshotHandle</ref>&apos;s HMAC before truncating the log; tampered snapshots cause <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_raft_snapshot_manager_1a25b04c4309e69323db5285917446fc38" kindref="member">compactLog()</ref> to fail.</para>
<para>Performance contracts: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_raft_snapshot_manager_1a36bdb22bf0db15b266fc59c973ae533f" kindref="member">initiateSnapshot()</ref> round-trip to future ready: ≤ 1 s. Compressed snapshot: &lt; 35% of uncompressed (ZSTD level 3). Lagging replica catch-up via snapshot transfer: &gt; 200 MB/s on 10 GbE. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
